## Testing

```powershell
python -m pytest
```

## Notes

- The API supports decision-making and screening, not final clinical diagnosis.
- Missing values are handled through the preprocessing pipeline and are also allowed in inference payloads.
- Categorical features are engineered from raw clinical measurements to satisfy production preprocessing requirements while keeping the public dataset fully programmatic.
